"value":2,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4476380","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4475970-1846651706691382","game_id":"steam-4475970","kind":"announcement","title":"Happy Next Fest!!","summary":"Jack and I hope you find tons of cool game during the next fest!! Thank you to everyone who's been wishlisthing and sharing Prerolled, It really makes a big difference in our days❤️❤️ The game comes out in less than a month, but it doesn't mean we haven't found ways to improve it even more!! Here is a little preview!Cool things we've been working on for the releaseVery cool descriptions and tooltipsWe went through all 200+ descriptions and made sure they followed the same structure and looked ni","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691382","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4475970-1842212951313021","game_id":"steam-4475970","kind":"update","title":"Big update with a new demo!!","summary":"We've been working super hard to make the game better, prettier and ready for the release (planned in November)!In fact, it improved so much since the last demo, that we made a new one!!What's newHere is a few of the major changes we made, but you can discover them yourself in the new demo of course!!Improved User Interface and VisualsWe worked on the UI and UX of all the menus in Game, and made some new one to support the new features added for the full game!New MapThe new map shows more inform","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T10:44:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951313021","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4475970-1833968530898911","game_id":"steam-4475970","kind":"announcement","title":"Small bugfix and nicer cursors for the Demo!","summary":"Hi all, This is a tiny update that is mainly to address a couple of niche bugs that have been found and fixed. I have also thrown in a couple of bonus changes that might make your experience slightly better. Bugfixes: - Relics now remember if they were deactivated between runs, and show appropriately in the preview. - The \"Even Steven\" event's first option now wont randomly reject your dice for no reason. - The box upgrade reward from the \"Big Brain\" event will now always make your box bigger, e","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-01T22:25:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530898911","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4475970":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:11Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:11Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4475970":"2026-10-26T12:31:11Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4475970":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:11Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:11Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:11Z"},"4476380":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:11Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:11Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:11Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4475970","app_id":4475970,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:37Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"27aec5f748661c